"""According to Case 1 of the query rewrite rule, the transformations applied are:

* Directly apply the GROUP BY and aggregate functions to the data source referred to in the FROM clause of the inner query before the projection.
* Eliminate the outer projection layer if it only renames the columns without transforming them.

